# Determinism & versioning

Rule engine (compliance pass/fail) must never call an LLM or any non-deterministic service at evaluation time. Model/extraction logic belongs in the extraction stage, not the rule engine.

Anywhere the spec describes an "override" or "edit" of something already generated (report, verdict): leave the original untouched and INSERT a new linked version. Never overwrite history. Before UPDATE on a report/verdict row, check whether it should be a new version INSERT instead.
